  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You bend light to render a creature imperceptible to sight.</p><p>Choose yourself or an adjacent creature.</p><p>For <strong>1 minute</strong>, the target creature is Invisible. It cannot be seen, and has <strong>Greater Advantage</strong> on <strong>Stealth</strong> checks to move silently.</p><p>If the creature performs an <strong>Action</strong> on another creature, or moves a large object not on its person, the spell ends as it fails to conceal the change in light.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 minutes</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.8NLQz7ajGIIzheB5]{Invisibility}</p>",
